1
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:11,720
P'Best.

2
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,120
Oh.

3
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:14,700
Uh...

4
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,240
Have you ordered your food yet?

5
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,360
If you haven't, I can order for you.

6
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,380
I'm just waiting here.

7
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,320
Oh, by the way...

8
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:23,500
Why is the rent so cheap?

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:25,600
Uh...

10
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:27,740
Well, you aren't staying for long, P'Best.

11
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,520
If you happen to stay longer,

12
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:31,780
I can recalculate the price then.

13
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:34,660
Mmm.

14
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,700
So, how was taking P'Dan over there?

15
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:38,560
It was okay, bro.

16
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,920
The condo is nearby.

17
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,100
P'Dan will probably like it.

18
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,240
Mmm...

19
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:43,900
That's good then.

20
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:47,100
Hope Dan can get along living there.

21
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,800
Mmm...

22
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:52,720
I think...

23
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,940
Those two should get along well.

24
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:56,980
Mmm.

25
00:00:57,620 --> 00:00:58,540
That's good.

26
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,800
Allow me to pull up a chair first, okay?

27
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:04,580
Sure.

28
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:07,500
This place looks nice.

29
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:11,020
I saw they have keychains too.

30
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:14,160
153 baht... oops, 150 baht.

31
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:44,580
Hey!?

32
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,800
Wha... what are you doing?

33
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:49,280
I'm going to charge my phone.

34
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:52,180
Why charge it right here?

35
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,780
There's an outlet over there, why not use that one?

36
00:02:53,780 --> 00:02:54,600
There's one over there too.

37
00:02:55,380 --> 00:02:56,720
Because this spot is mine.

38
00:02:58,480 --> 00:02:59,900
This room is mine too.

39
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:01,140
That over there is mine.

40
00:03:01,140 --> 00:03:02,200
That one is mine too.

41
00:03:03,140 --> 00:03:04,560
And...

42
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,720
this...

43
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,860
is also mine.

44
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:13,580
The bed?

45
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:15,140
The pillow?

46
00:03:15,140 --> 00:03:15,960
The blanket?

47
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:17,200
You.

48
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,540
Can you be mine?

49
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,440
There's a bed available,

50
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,440
yet you slept on the sofa.

51
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,120
It's all because of you.

52
00:04:31,460 --> 00:04:32,540
Because of me doing what?

53
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,780
All the stuff in this room,

54
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:36,380
you can use any of it.

55
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:38,940
You just chose not to use it yourself.

56
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,420
Who would want to use it like this, man?

57
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:44,940
Here.

58
00:04:45,460 --> 00:04:46,060
Water.

59
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:48,360
Don't you usually drink right when you wake up?

60
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:19,260
P'Dan.

61
00:05:19,780 --> 00:05:20,920
How was last night?

62
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:23,580
Huh...

63
00:05:23,580 --> 00:05:24,200
What?

64
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:25,760
How was last night?

65
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:27,860
Oh.

66
00:05:28,060 --> 00:05:29,780
It was okay, nothing special happened.

67
00:05:30,100 --> 00:05:31,440
It was just normal.

68
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:33,160
No, nothing happened.

69
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:35,500
I meant the work you took home last night, bro.

70
00:05:35,500 --> 00:05:36,380
Oh.

71
00:05:36,380 --> 00:05:37,400
It's finished, right?

72
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:38,720
Yeah.

73
00:05:41,620 --> 00:05:42,800
Yeah, it's finished.

74
00:05:43,740 --> 00:05:45,920
I sent it since this morning, didn't you know?

75
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,200
Is there something going on besides work?

76
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:52,820
Nothing at all.

77
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:56,400
I sent... sent it already, early this morning.

78
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:58,160
Oh... you already sent it?

79
00:05:59,220 --> 00:06:00,800
Is your mind wandering off somewhere?

80
00:06:04,620 --> 00:06:05,140
No.

81
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,320
Hey, bro.

82
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:09,060
Could you teach Pond that task?

83
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:10,480
The task you once taught me.

84
00:06:10,660 --> 00:06:12,360
Since I haven't used it, I forgot.

85
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,800
Wait... how could you forget?

86
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,200
Hey,

87
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:16,240
I just told you, if I don't use it, I forget it.

88
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,120
But I...

89
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,160
Come on, man.

90
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,220
Please teach Pond a bit.

91
00:06:19,220 --> 00:06:20,660
I have a meeting this afternoon.

92
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:22,500
Hey,

93
00:06:23,180 --> 00:06:24,060
teach the kid a little.

94
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,560
If you have questions, just ask him.

95
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,340
Got it, bro.

96
00:06:42,060 --> 00:06:42,980
Hey, P'Dan.

97
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,020
Come help me look at this part.

98
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:46,640
I don't get it.

99
00:06:49,900 --> 00:06:50,680
P'Dan.

100
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:52,700
Come on, hurry.

101
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:56,200
Yeah, I'll teach you this afternoon.

102
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:57,600
Otherwise, my work won't get done.

103
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:07,300
Please, take a seat.

104
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:14,220
Oh,

105
00:07:14,220 --> 00:07:16,020
you need to fix the if( ){ } first.

106
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:18,160
Otherwise, it can't echo " "; like this.

107
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:22,680
You mean right here?

108
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,760
Yeah.

109
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:28,660
See that?

110
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,960
When you teach me like this...

111
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,620
It reminds me of back then, right?

112
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,920
Do you have a new boyfriend yet?

113
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:50,680
All this time...

114
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,100
didn't you miss me at all?

115
00:08:02,620 --> 00:08:03,240
I think...

116
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,820
this isn't about work anymore.

117
00:08:04,820 --> 00:08:06,020
But it's about me.

118
00:08:12,740 --> 00:08:13,420
I'll...

119
00:08:13,420 --> 00:08:14,180
go...

120
00:08:14,180 --> 00:08:14,960
answer a phone call...

121
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:15,940
first.

122
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,720
Hey man, let go of my arm.

123
00:08:33,980 --> 00:08:34,880
What's up with you?

124
00:08:35,180 --> 00:08:36,140
Let go of my arm.

125
00:08:36,460 --> 00:08:37,460
What's wrong with you?

126
00:08:37,460 --> 00:08:39,700
I need to hurry and submit the work to P'Best before 4:00 PM.

127
00:08:39,940 --> 00:08:41,640
Submit the work before 4:00 PM?

128
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:42,940
Then what time are you going to hit on P'Best?

129
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,020
5:00 PM?

130
00:08:44,020 --> 00:08:45,140
Or 6:00 PM?

131
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:48,100
Whatever time I hit on him, that's my business.

132
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:49,840
I hit on him every day anyway.

133
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,900
Can you hurry up and get serious about it, man?

134
00:08:51,900 --> 00:08:54,360
Are you just gonna sit there staring at him while he works...

135
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,260
and sit there smiling when he briefs you?

136
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:57,740
What the hell is that gonna achieve, bro?

137
00:08:58,460 --> 00:09:00,060
Then what do you want me to do?

138
00:09:00,060 --> 00:09:01,480
Tricking him into holding hands...

139
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,980
like you do?

140
00:09:03,900 --> 00:09:04,580
Heh.

141
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:06,440
Have you ever heard the saying?

142
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:09,660
Constant dripping hollows out a stone.

143
00:09:09,660 --> 00:09:11,180
The stone erodes, right?

144
00:09:11,180 --> 00:09:12,660
Except the stone moves away.

145
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:14,680
Who's running away from whom, bro?

146
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:15,960
If it were me, I wouldn't let them run away.

147
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:18,140
No matter how far they run,

148
00:09:18,540 --> 00:09:20,640
I would still follow that stone anyway.

149
00:09:23,500 --> 00:09:24,420
You speak well.

150
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,560
You make a good point.

151
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:28,240
Hearing that gives me passion!

152
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:29,240
Alright.

153
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,100
I'm gonna flirt with P'Best even more.

154
00:09:31,100 --> 00:09:32,520
I'm gonna be even bolder.

155
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:34,760
I have to make it happen.

156
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:35,440
Let's go.

157
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,400
Go get 'em!

158
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:37,860
I have to make it happen.

159
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:40,360
I have to win him over.

160
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,280
Let's go, bro!

161
00:09:57,820 --> 00:09:58,560
Oops...

162
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:00,900
I'm sorry, bro.

163
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:02,320
I was just...

164
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,980
looking at these things and wasn't watching where I was going.

165
00:10:03,980 --> 00:10:05,120
I'm sorry.

166
00:10:05,580 --> 00:10:07,280
Walking without looking like that...

167
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,300
Are you thinking about someone?

168
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:13,120
I miss them, but I don't know if my feelings reach them.

169
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:17,060
Sorry, I let my inner thoughts slip out.

170
00:10:17,060 --> 00:10:18,000
Uh...

171
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,660
I meant I was going to...

172
00:10:19,660 --> 00:10:21,480
take these things...

173
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:23,640
and deliver them straight to the team.

174
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:25,420
Oh, I see.

175
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,260
Hey Ton.

176
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:30,860
I noticed a box in front of the TV.

177
00:10:30,860 --> 00:10:32,120
Is it yours?

178
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,640
The box in front of the TV?

179
00:10:35,820 --> 00:10:36,600
Oh!

180
00:10:37,180 --> 00:10:39,620
That's probably my older brother's birthday gift.

181
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:40,940
Yeah, I forgot it there.

182
00:10:41,700 --> 00:10:42,320
Okay.

183
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:44,260
Then I'll bring it to you tomorrow.

184
00:10:44,880 --> 00:10:45,900
That's fine, bro.

185
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:47,140
I can...

186
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,180
I can drop by and pick it up.

187
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,120
Drop by to pick it up?

188
00:10:51,660 --> 00:10:52,460
When? Right now?

189
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:52,900
Yes.

190
00:10:52,900 --> 00:10:53,760
Is that convenient for you?

191
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:55,680
If it's not convenient, it's totally okay.

192
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:56,440
But I'm free.

193
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,380
I'll...

194
00:10:58,380 --> 00:11:00,560
go get it myself so it won't be a hassle for you.

195
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:03,180
Well, if you want it now...

196
00:11:03,340 --> 00:11:04,960
Give me a moment, okay?

197
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,860
Let me pack my things first.

198
00:11:06,860 --> 00:11:08,320
Okay. / Yeah.

199
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,480
Hurry up, bro.

200
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:15,120
Alright.

201
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:16,700
All done.

202
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,340
Bro, let's eat together.

203
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:29,180
I made some for you too.

204
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:32,080
I'm not hungry.

205
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:35,240
But I made your favorite dish!

206
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,180
I'm really not hungry.

207
00:11:46,860 --> 00:11:49,140
It's delicious, bro. Try a bite first.

208
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,000
What is your problem, man?

209
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:59,520
Or maybe you're not hungry for food

210
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,120
...you're hungry for me?

211
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:16,120
I think I'll just eat...

212
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:16,840
the food.

213
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:18,360
I'll go get...

214
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,000
some plain rice.

215
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:19,920
Plain rice.

216
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:22,080
Plain rice, yeah. I'll get plain rice.

217
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:36,600
Did you get the rice yet?

218
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:38,060
Got it.

219
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:44,740
Alright.

220
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:46,720
Let's eat.

221
00:12:47,060 --> 00:12:48,140
I'll go get another plate.

222
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:52,160
Just sit down. Let's eat together from this one.

223
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:53,600
From the same plate.

224
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:54,780
There's no room on the table anyway.

225
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,740
Are you gonna eat it yourself or should I feed you?

226
00:12:58,740 --> 00:13:00,380
I'll eat it myself, I'll eat it myself.

227
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:01,740
But there's only one spoon.

228
00:13:01,740 --> 00:13:03,500
Then you'll have to feed me.

229
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:07,180
Fine, I'll just eat this part.

230
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:08,480
You take the rest.

231
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:35,960
P'Dan...

232
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:38,340
Can I ask you something?

233
00:13:40,180 --> 00:13:41,720
P'Ton likes P'Best.

234
00:13:42,380 --> 00:13:44,720
So why doesn't P'Best like P'Ton back?

235
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:51,360
How does knowing about those two...

236
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,540
do you any good?

237
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:59,140
Then... can I ask about your story instead?

238
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,680
If I knew more about you...

239
00:14:03,540 --> 00:14:05,600
it would probably be good for my life.

240
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:14,160
Don't you want to know about my future?

241
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:24,880
Whatever is in the past, why can't you just let it go?

242
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,720
Well, if I could just let it go easily...

243
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:40,780
and forget everything as easily as you do...

244
00:14:42,740 --> 00:14:43,960
that would be nice.

